# R-87: every surviving mutant is listed, with its reason; a listed one that is caught
# or gone fails. (Enforced once the kernel is set, R-85.)

case: unlisted-survivor
tool: run
expect: (missed) is not in MUTANTS-SURVIVORS.md (R-87)
--- write zz-mutants/mutants.out/outcomes.json
{"outcomes": [
 {"scenario": "Baseline", "summary": "Success"},
 {"scenario": {"Mutant": {"name": "crates/tally/src/lib.rs:18:5: replace parse -> Result<(), NotImplemented> with Ok(())",
  "file": "crates/tally/src/lib.rs", "function": {"function_name": "parse"}}}, "summary": "MissedMutant"},
 {"scenario": {"Mutant": {"name": "crates/tally/src/lib.rs:9:1: replace planted -> u8 with 0",
  "file": "crates/tally/src/lib.rs", "function": {"function_name": "planted"}}}, "summary": "CaughtMutant"}
]}
--- run
tools/mutants-survivors zz-mutants

case: listed-but-caught
tool: run
expect: is listed in MUTANTS-SURVIVORS.md and is now caught
--- append MUTANTS-SURVIVORS.md
| crates/tally/src/lib.rs | parse | replace parse -> Result<(), NotImplemented> with Ok(()) | R-87: equivalent: a planted row whose mutant is caught |
--- write zz-mutants/mutants.out/outcomes.json
{"outcomes": [
 {"scenario": {"Mutant": {"name": "crates/tally/src/lib.rs:18:5: replace parse -> Result<(), NotImplemented> with Ok(())",
  "file": "crates/tally/src/lib.rs", "function": {"function_name": "parse"}}}, "summary": "CaughtMutant"}
]}
--- run
tools/mutants-survivors zz-mutants

case: listed-but-gone
tool: run
expect: no run produced it
--- append MUTANTS-SURVIVORS.md
| crates/tally/src/lib.rs | gone | replace gone -> u8 with 1 | R-87: equivalent: a planted row whose mutant no longer exists |
--- write zz-mutants/mutants.out/outcomes.json
{"outcomes": []}
--- run
tools/mutants-survivors zz-mutants

case: row-without-reason
tool: run
expect: the reason must say why the mutant is equivalent
--- append MUTANTS-SURVIVORS.md
| crates/tally/src/lib.rs | parse | replace parse -> Result<(), NotImplemented> with Ok(()) | equivalent |
--- write zz-mutants/mutants.out/outcomes.json
{"outcomes": [
 {"scenario": {"Mutant": {"name": "crates/tally/src/lib.rs:18:5: replace parse -> Result<(), NotImplemented> with Ok(())",
  "file": "crates/tally/src/lib.rs", "function": {"function_name": "parse"}}}, "summary": "MissedMutant"}
]}
--- run
tools/mutants-survivors zz-mutants

case: timeout-counts-as-survivor
tool: run
expect: (timed out) is not in MUTANTS-SURVIVORS.md (R-87)
--- write zz-mutants/mutants.out/outcomes.json
{"outcomes": [
 {"scenario": {"Mutant": {"name": "crates/tally/src/lib.rs:18:5: replace parse -> Result<(), NotImplemented> with Ok(())",
  "file": "crates/tally/src/lib.rs", "function": {"function_name": "parse"}}}, "summary": "Timeout"}
]}
--- run
tools/mutants-survivors zz-mutants

case: score-under-gate-8
tool: run
expect: is under DONE gate 8's 90 %
--- append MUTANTS-SURVIVORS.md
| crates/tally/src/lib.rs | parse | replace parse -> Result<(), NotImplemented> with Ok(()) | R-87: missed: a planted row; one survivor in two is a score of 50 % |
--- write zz-mutants/mutants.out/outcomes.json
{"outcomes": [
 {"scenario": {"Mutant": {"name": "crates/tally/src/lib.rs:18:5: replace parse -> Result<(), NotImplemented> with Ok(())",
  "file": "crates/tally/src/lib.rs", "function": {"function_name": "parse"}}}, "summary": "MissedMutant"},
 {"scenario": {"Mutant": {"name": "crates/tally/src/lib.rs:9:1: replace planted -> u8 with 0",
  "file": "crates/tally/src/lib.rs", "function": {"function_name": "planted"}}}, "summary": "CaughtMutant"}
]}
--- run
tools/mutants-survivors zz-mutants

case: survivor-not-equivalent
tool: run
expect: the reason must say why the mutant is equivalent
--- append MUTANTS-SURVIVORS.md
| crates/tally/src/lib.rs | parse | replace parse -> Result<(), NotImplemented> with Ok(()) | R-28: the tests don't reach this planted branch yet |
--- write zz-mutants/mutants.out/outcomes.json
{"outcomes": [
 {"scenario": "Baseline", "summary": "Success"},
 {"scenario": {"Mutant": {"name": "crates/tally/src/lib.rs:18:5: replace parse -> Result<(), NotImplemented> with Ok(())",
  "file": "crates/tally/src/lib.rs", "function": {"function_name": "parse"}}}, "summary": "MissedMutant"}
]}
--- run
tools/mutants-survivors zz-mutants

# 2026-11-03 (issue #41): a survivor listed `R-87: equivalent:` leaves the scored count,
# one per mutant, not per row; one listed `R-87: missed:` stays counted.

case: equivalents-leave-the-count
tool: run
exit: any
expect: score 90.0% = caught 9 / (caught 9 + missed 3 + timed out 0 - equivalent 2)
expect: every survivor is listed, with its reason
expect: r87-score-passed
--- write MUTANTS-SURVIVORS.md
| file | function | mutation | reason |
| ---- | -------- | -------- | ------ |
| crates/tally/src/lib.rs | parse | replace parse -> Result<(), NotImplemented> with Ok(()) | R-87: equivalent: a planted row; both columns' mutants leave the count |
| crates/tally/src/lib.rs | other | replace other -> bool with true | R-87: missed: a planted row; a test could tell it apart, none does yet |
--- write zz-mutants/mutants.out/outcomes.json
{"outcomes": [
 {"scenario": "Baseline", "summary": "Success"},
 {"scenario": {"Mutant": {"name": "crates/tally/src/lib.rs:9:1: replace planted -> u8 with 0",
  "file": "crates/tally/src/lib.rs", "function": {"function_name": "planted"}}}, "summary": "CaughtMutant"},
 {"scenario": {"Mutant": {"name": "crates/tally/src/lib.rs:9:2: replace planted -> u8 with 1",
  "file": "crates/tally/src/lib.rs", "function": {"function_name": "planted"}}}, "summary": "CaughtMutant"},
 {"scenario": {"Mutant": {"name": "crates/tally/src/lib.rs:9:3: replace planted -> u8 with 2",
  "file": "crates/tally/src/lib.rs", "function": {"function_name": "planted"}}}, "summary": "CaughtMutant"},
 {"scenario": {"Mutant": {"name": "crates/tally/src/lib.rs:9:4: replace planted -> u8 with 3",
  "file": "crates/tally/src/lib.rs", "function": {"function_name": "planted"}}}, "summary": "CaughtMutant"},
 {"scenario": {"Mutant": {"name": "crates/tally/src/lib.rs:9:5: replace planted -> u8 with 4",
  "file": "crates/tally/src/lib.rs", "function": {"function_name": "planted"}}}, "summary": "CaughtMutant"},
 {"scenario": {"Mutant": {"name": "crates/tally/src/lib.rs:9:6: replace planted -> u8 with 5",
  "file": "crates/tally/src/lib.rs", "function": {"function_name": "planted"}}}, "summary": "CaughtMutant"},
 {"scenario": {"Mutant": {"name": "crates/tally/src/lib.rs:9:7: replace planted -> u8 with 6",
  "file": "crates/tally/src/lib.rs", "function": {"function_name": "planted"}}}, "summary": "CaughtMutant"},
 {"scenario": {"Mutant": {"name": "crates/tally/src/lib.rs:9:8: replace planted -> u8 with 7",
  "file": "crates/tally/src/lib.rs", "function": {"function_name": "planted"}}}, "summary": "CaughtMutant"},
 {"scenario": {"Mutant": {"name": "crates/tally/src/lib.rs:9:9: replace planted -> u8 with 8",
  "file": "crates/tally/src/lib.rs", "function": {"function_name": "planted"}}}, "summary": "CaughtMutant"},
 {"scenario": {"Mutant": {"name": "crates/tally/src/lib.rs:18:5: replace parse -> Result<(), NotImplemented> with Ok(())",
  "file": "crates/tally/src/lib.rs", "function": {"function_name": "parse"}}}, "summary": "MissedMutant"},
 {"scenario": {"Mutant": {"name": "crates/tally/src/lib.rs:18:40: replace parse -> Result<(), NotImplemented> with Ok(())",
  "file": "crates/tally/src/lib.rs", "function": {"function_name": "parse"}}}, "summary": "MissedMutant"},
 {"scenario": {"Mutant": {"name": "crates/tally/src/lib.rs:30:1: replace other -> bool with true",
  "file": "crates/tally/src/lib.rs", "function": {"function_name": "other"}}}, "summary": "MissedMutant"}
]}
--- run
tools/mutants-survivors zz-mutants && echo r87-score-passed

